<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-060" chapter-id="c-jinshu-060-appraisal-first" source-id="s-jinshu-060-appraisal-first-ws2413335">
  <p id="c-jinshu-060-appraisal-first:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：晉氏之禍難薦臻，實始籓翰。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-appraisal-first:p001:m0017" ref="1ao_22d_odr">解系</persName>等以幹時之用，處危亂之辰，並托跡府朝，參謀王室。或抗忠盡節，或飾詐懷奸。雖邪正殊途，而咸至誅戮，豈非時艱政紊，利深禍速者乎！古人所以危邦不入，亂邦不居，戒懼於此也。</p>
</text>
